# Mapping & Navigation
- Use dependency graphs in `/docs/maps/` to answer “where is X called / what depends on Y?”.
- Provide path summaries (package → module → symbol) and link to `Modules.md` entries.
- After changing imports/boundaries, regenerate the graph and update module docs.
